      "name": "Traits",
      "rulesText": "Pack Tactics. The shark has Advantage on an attack roll against a creature if at least one of the shark's allies is within 5 feet of the creature and the ally doesn't have the Incapacitated condition.\n\nWater Breathing. The shark can breathe only underwater.",
